    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\u201CI won\u2019t let your judgement imprison the few pieces that remain
    of who I once was. Whisper your shallow pity if you must. Fear the tragic alleyway
    that led my soul to fracture or pretend that you understand, it has no consequence.
    I alone dictate what remains behind in these final moments. Feed your superstitions
    with whatever filth spills from your corrupted minds, but know this,  the truth
    is mine to command.\r\n"
